  - battery management system

license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-02"

abstract: >-
  Python simulation and post-processing code for impedance identification of
  cell groups in a self-reconfigurable battery by pseudo-random switching
  (pseudo-EIS). Contains the cross-spectral estimator, the convex
  equivalent-circuit fit, a PyBaMM Doyle-Fuller-Newman truth model
  (Chen2020 parameters scaled to 60 Ah), the stored simulation results, and
  the scripts that regenerate every reported number, table and figure.

repository-code: "https://github.com/askegro/c3-pseudo-eis-srb"

